Z||000006||WKDFIRO||12-25-2000||03:39 AM||||Cradle bushings easier to put on?<P>The rear bushings yes but the fronts? EEK!<BR>I got lucky and changed the cradle bushings while the engine was out (burned out the front bushings) but I helped someone with theirs and it was not super difficult but not the most fun either!<P>The control arm bushings IMO were WAY easier to take off, burn out and put on! I have urethane all around and in the dog bone and yes you pick up some additional vibration but nothing bone jarring nor annoying in any sense!<P>Urethane - they'll out last your Fiero!||||reg||14
