Z||000015||WKDFIRO||12-27-2000||03:54 PM||||"True sports car nuts don’t care about noise vehicle harshness."<P>We had one customer who thought along those lines and just about solid mounted his built up 4 cylinder with urethane engine mounts. That was getting a little ridiculous. He brought it in for a tune up at our shop and the whole car was just one great big vibrator! Strong enough for the man but definitely made for a woman! <P>The point was that the engine was starting to loosen up bolts from the vibrations. With no give it was now a matter of how strong the actual brackets were before they begin to crack. Never found out what happened to him after Fiero Motorsports closed. <BR>||||reg||11
