Z||000020||Verticalspeed||12-28-2000||07:08 PM|||| I just replaced all the front sway bar bushings with poly and I noticed a <B>big difference</B> in front end handling. The front end is stiffer now. With the exception of a toe-in<BR>problem on the right front tire, poly bushings made the car handle much better.<BR>The bushings cost $14.99 at Checkers. I also added the greaseable mount bushings.||||reg||1
